      "en": "Agent = Harness + Plugins/Packages. This index carries all three tiers — plugins as atoms, groups as reusable sets, and Agents as complete profiles you can boot — and each is one xpkg descriptor, so xlings resolves the dependencies and writes the profile for you.",
      "zh": "Agent = dsh + 一组插件。本索引收录三层：插件是原子，插件组是可复用组合，Agent 是可直接启动的完整 profile —— 每一层都是一个 xpkg 描述文件，xlings 会替你解析依赖并写好 profile。",
      "zh-Hant": "Agent = dsh + 一組外掛。本索引收錄三層：外掛是原子，外掛組是可重用組合，Agent 是可直接啟動的完整 profile —— 每一層都是一個 xpkg 描述檔，xlings 會替你解析相依並寫好 profile。"
